      "id": "scene-002",
      "startFrame": 530,
      "durationFrames": 552,
      "sourceInFrame": 531,
      "narration": "Adding another copy only helps when the failure that breaks one copy leaves the other useful. Imagine two application servers behind a load balancer. Both depend on one database endpoint. When that shared dependency fails, the second application server is just another machine returning the same error.",
